theorem quad_root_smooth_sqrt : ∀ (q2 lam : ℝ) (q1 q0 : ℝ → ℝ), 0 < lam → lam ≤ 1 / 100 → 47 / 200 ≤ q2 → q2 ≤ 13 / 50 → ContDiff ℝ ∞ q1 → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ q0 (Ioo (-2) 2) → (∀ η : ℝ, -2 < η → η < 2 → |q1 η| ≤ lam ∧ -(27 / 100) ≤ q0 η ∧ q0 η ≤ -(47 / 200)) → (∀ η : ℝ, -1 ≤ η → η ≤ 1 → |deriv q1 η| + |deriv q0 η| ≤ Real.sqrt lam / 3) → ∃ Amp : ℝ → ℝ, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ Amp (Ioo (-2) 2) ∧ (∀ η : ℝ, -2 < η → η < 2 → q2 * Amp η ^ 2 + q1 η * Amp η + q0 η = 0) ∧ ∀ η : ℝ, -1 ≤ η → η ≤ 1 → 9 / 10 ≤ Amp η ∧ Amp η ≤ 6 / 5 ∧ |deriv Amp η| ≤ Real.sqrt lam :=
