theorem rfp_inter_ns_arith : ∀ h η X lx Pst Mk2 Mc Pi0 dPi : ℝ, 0 ≤ h → h ≤ 1 / 10 ^ 4 → -1 ≤ η → η ≤ 1 → 0 < X → 0 ≤ lx → 0 ≤ Mk2 → Mk2 ≤ 16 * Pst ^ 2 → 0 ≤ Mc → Mc ≤ 8 * Pst ^ 2 * (1 + lx) → |Pi0| ≤ 8 * Pst ^ 2 / X → |dPi| ≤ 32 * |η| * Pst ^ 2 / X → |η * (((4 * h * η ^ 2 - 2 * (1 - η ^ 2)) * Mk2 - 4 * (h + (1 - η ^ 2) * (1 + η ^ 2)⁻¹) * ((1 + η ^ 2)⁻¹) ^ 2 * Mc) / X) + 4 * (1 / 2 + h) * η * Pi0 - (1 - η ^ 2) * dPi| ≤ 200 * Pst ^ 2 * (1 + lx) * |η| / X :=
