theorem pulse_N_core : ∀ lam h η A A' a1 a1' a2 a2' p0 p1 p2 x e1 μ M0 M1 M2 KB K2 S0 S1 S2 S00 Pi Pi' : ℝ, 0 < lam → lam ≤ 1 / 100 → 0 ≤ h → h ≤ lam ^ 2 → -1 ≤ η → η ≤ 1 → 9 / 10 ≤ A → A ≤ 6 / 5 → |A'| ≤ Real.sqrt lam → |a1| + |a1'| ≤ lam ^ 20 → |a2| + |a2'| ≤ lam ^ 20 → 0 ≤ p0 → p0 ≤ 11 → 0 ≤ p1 → p1 ≤ 1 → 0 ≤ p2 → p2 ≤ 1 → 0 < x → 0 < e1 → e1 ≤ lam ^ 20 → 0 ≤ μ → μ ≤ 23 → M0 = x * e1 * μ → 0 ≤ M1 → M1 ≤ 3 * (x * e1) → 0 ≤ M2 → M2 ≤ 3 * (x * e1) → 0 ≤ KB → KB ≤ lam ^ 50 * x → 0 ≤ K2 → K2 ≤ lam ^ 20 * (x * e1) → 0 ≤ S00 → S00 ≤ lam ^ 10 * (x * e1) → 0 ≤ S0 → S0 ≤ 121 * S00 → 0 ≤ S1 → S1 ≤ S00 → 0 ≤ S2 → S2 ≤ S00 → |Pi| ≤ e1 ^ 2 → |Pi'| ≤ 4 * e1 ^ 2 → |pulseNForm h η A A' a1 a1' a2 a2' p0 p1 p2 x e1 M0 M1 M2 KB K2 S0 S1 S2 S00 Pi Pi' - (-(A * p0) + (1 / 2 - h + (1 - 2 * h) * η ^ 2 / (1 + η ^ 2)) * A * μ - (1 / 2 - h) * η * A' * μ)| ≤ lam ^ 3 :=
