theorem cone_data_lipschitz : ∀ (h K c x1 x2 : ℝ), 0 < h → h < 1 / 100 → 0 < c → 0 < x1 → x1 ≤ x2 → ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ (ε : ℝ) (F U G V : ℝ → ℝ → ℝ), 0 ≤ ε → ε ≤ 1 → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (↿F) (Ioi 0 ×ˢ Ioo (-1) 1) → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (↿U) (Ioi 0 ×ˢ Ioo (-1) 1) → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (↿G) (Ioi 0 ×ˢ Ioo (-1) 1) → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (↿V) (Ioi 0 ×ˢ Ioo (-1) 1) → (∀ x η : ℝ, x1 ≤ x → x ≤ x2 → -1 < η → η < 1 → c ≤ F x η ∧ c ≤ G x η ∧ |deriv (fun Y => F Y η) x| ≤ K ∧ |deriv (fun Y => U Y η) x| ≤ K ∧ |deriv (fun Y => G Y η - F Y η) x| ≤ ε * K ∧ |deriv (fun Y => V Y η - U Y η) x| ≤ ε * K) → (∀ j : ℕ, j ≤ 1 → ∀ x η : ℝ, 0 < x → -1 < η → η < 1 → |iteratedDeriv j (fun e => F x e) η| ≤ K * x ^ (-(2 / 5 : ℝ)) * (1 + x) ^ (-(3 / 5 + h)) ∧ |iteratedDeriv j (fun e => U x e) η| ≤ K ∧ |iteratedDeriv j (fun e => G x e - F x e) η| ≤ ε * K * x ^ (-(2 / 5 : ℝ)) * (1 + x) ^ (-(3 / 5 + h)) ∧ |iteratedDeriv j (fun e => V x e - U x e) η| ≤ ε * K) → ∀ x η : ℝ, x1 ≤ x → x ≤ x2 → -1 < η → η < 1 → |G x η - F x η| ≤ C * ε ∧ |shearA G x η - shearA F x η| ≤ C * ε ∧ |shearB G V x η - shearB F U x η| ≤ C * ε ∧ |psLead1 h G V x η - psLead1 h F U x η| ≤ C * ε ∧ |psLead2 h G V x η - psLead2 h F U x η| ≤ C * ε :=
