    · exact key _ Cd1 gdD1 (fun X η a b c d => (hD1 X η a b c d).2.2.2.2) (by rw [hCr]; linarith)
    · exact key _ Cd2 gdD2 (fun X η a b c d => (hD2 X η a b c d).2.2.2.2) (by rw [hCr]; linarith)
