theorem ax_ff_natural_bounds : ∀ (h j0 σ δ Λ C K ρ1 t1 : ℝ) (Pax : ℝ → ℝ) (Kder M : ℕ → ℝ) (Fn Un : ℝ → ℝ → ℝ), 1 ≤ Λ → 0 < ρ1 → 0 < t1 → t1 ≤ 1 / 100 → AxAxisOut h j0 σ δ Pax Λ C K ρ1 Kder Fn Un → AxRefPI h j0 σ Pax Λ C K ρ1 M (axRefF Λ t1 Fn) (axRefU Λ t1 Un) → ∃ Cc : ℝ, 1 ≤ Cc ∧ ∀ X η : ℝ, 4 / Λ ≤ X → X ≤ 4 / Λ * Real.exp (t1 / 2) → -1 < η → η < 1 → 1 / Cc ≤ Fn X η ∧ Fn X η ≤ Cc ∧ 1 / Cc ≤ shearA Fn X η ∧ shearA Fn X η ≤ Cc ∧ |shearB Fn Un X η| ≤ Cc ∧ 21 / 10 < shearA Fn X η + shearB Fn Un X η ^ 2 / shearA Fn X η :=
by
