theorem afc_smooth_eta : AxDatumSmooth → ∀ (h Pst : ℝ) (Pax : ℝ → ℝ), AxDatum h Pst Pax → ∀ (j0 σ δ ρ : ℝ) (Pc : ℂ → ℂ), 0 < j0 → j0 ≤ 1 / 20 → AxData h j0 σ δ ρ Pc Pax → ∀ (Λ C K ρ1 t1 κ0 om : ℝ) (Kder M : ℕ → ℝ) (Fn Un : ℝ → ℝ → ℝ), 1 ≤ Λ → 0 < K → 0 < ρ1 → 0 < t1 → t1 ≤ 1 / 100 → 0 < κ0 → κ0 < 1 / 2 → 0 < om → om ≤ 1 / 25 → AxAxisOut h j0 σ δ Pax Λ C K ρ1 Kder Fn Un → AxRefPI h j0 σ Pax Λ C K ρ1 M (axRefF Λ t1 Fn) (axRefU Λ t1 Un) → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (↿(axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un)) (Ioi (-1 / Λ) ×ˢ Ioo (-1) 1) ∧ ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (↿(axProfU h Λ t1 κ0 om Pax Fn Un)) (Ioi (-1 / Λ) ×ˢ Ioo (-1) 1) ∧ (∀ X η : ℝ, 0 ≤ X → -1 < η → η < 1 → 0 < axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un X η) ∧ ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (↿(psLead1 h (axRefF Λ t1 Fn) (axRefU Λ t1 Un))) (Ioi 0 ×ˢ Ioo (-1) 1) ∧ ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun z : ℝ × ℝ => z.1 * axNs h Pax (axRefF Λ t1 Fn) (axRefU Λ t1 Un) z.1 z.2 / (1 - 2 * h * z.2 ^ 2)) (Ioi 0 ×ˢ Ioo (-1) 1) ∧ (∀ X η : ℝ, 4 / Λ < X → -1 < η → η < 1 → HasDerivAt (fun Y => axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un Y η) (-(1 / 2) * axShearA h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un (axLogY Λ X) η * axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un X η / X) X ∧ HasDerivAt (fun Y => axProfU h Λ t1 κ0 om Pax Fn Un Y η) (axSlopeU h Λ t1 κ0 om Pax Fn Un (axLogY Λ X) η / X) X) ∧ (∀ X η : ℝ, 4 / Λ * Real.exp (2 * t1) ≤ X → axRefF Λ t1 Fn X η = axRefF Λ t1 Fn (4 / Λ * Real.exp (2 * t1)) η ∧ axRefU Λ t1 Un X η = axRefU Λ t1 Un (4 / Λ * Real.exp (2 * t1)) η) ∧ (∀ X η : ℝ, 100 * Real.exp om ≤ X → -1 < η → η < 1 → axProfU h Λ t1 κ0 om Pax Fn Un X η = axProfU h Λ t1 κ0 om Pax Fn Un (100 * Real.exp om) η ∧ axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un X η = axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un (100 * Real.exp om) η * Real.exp (-(2 / 5) * Real.log (X / (100 * Real.exp om)))) :=
by
  intro hSm h Pst Pax hD j0 σ δ ρ Pc hj0 hj0' hAD Λ C K ρ1 t1 κ0 om Kder M Fn Un hΛ hK hρ1 ht1 ht1'
    hκ0 hκ0' hom hom' hA hR
