theorem afc_close : AxDatumSmooth → ∀ (h Pst : ℝ) (Pax : ℝ → ℝ), AxDatum h Pst Pax → ∀ (j0 σ δ ρ : ℝ) (Pc : ℂ → ℂ), 0 < j0 → j0 ≤ 1 / 20 → AxData h j0 σ δ ρ Pc Pax → ∀ (Λ C K ρ1 ts : ℝ) (Kder M : ℕ → ℝ) (Fn Un : ℝ → ℝ → ℝ), 1 ≤ Λ → 0 < K → 0 < ρ1 → 0 < ts → ts ≤ 1 / 100 → AxAxisOut h j0 σ δ Pax Λ C K ρ1 Kder Fn Un → (∀ t1 : ℝ, 0 < t1 → t1 ≤ ts → AxRefPI h j0 σ Pax Λ C K ρ1 M (axRefF Λ t1 Fn) (axRefU Λ t1 Un)) → ∃ Ac : ℝ, 0 ≤ Ac ∧ ∀ t1 κ0 om : ℝ, 0 < t1 → t1 ≤ ts → 0 < κ0 → κ0 < 1 / 2 → 0 < om → om ≤ 1 / 25 → ∀ X η : ℝ, 0 ≤ X → X ≤ 110 → -1 < η → η < 1 → |axProfU h Λ t1 κ0 om Pax Fn Un X η - axRefU Λ t1 Un X η| ≤ Ac * (t1 + κ0 + om) ∧ |deriv (fun e => axProfU h Λ t1 κ0 om Pax Fn Un X e) η - deriv (fun e => axRefU Λ t1 Un X e) η| ≤ Ac * (t1 + κ0 + om) ∧ |deriv (fun e => axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un X e) η / axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un X η - deriv (fun e => axRefF Λ t1 Fn X e) η / axRefF Λ t1 Fn X η| ≤ Ac * (t1 + κ0 + om) ∧ |leadW h (axProfU h Λ t1 κ0 om Pax Fn Un) X η - leadW h (axRefU Λ t1 Un) X η| ≤ 2 * (Ac * (t1 + κ0 + om)) ∧ (X ≤ 100 * Real.exp om → |Real.log (axProfF h Λ t1 κ0 om Fn Un X η) - Real.log (axRefF Λ t1 Fn X η)| ≤ Ac * (t1 + κ0 + om)) :=
