        0 ≤ B →
        (∀ j, j ≤ m → ∀ x, X ≤ x → x < Xb → ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ j (↿g) (x, η)‖ ≤ B) →
        ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m P (X, η)‖ ≤ 2 ^ m * A * B := by
