theorem tH_transversal_v5 : ∀ (B : BG) (G : CorrGeom), B.ok → GeomPrim5 B G → ∀ (γ : Lab) (ξ : Cyl), ActiveL4 B G γ → etaL B.h γ ξ ≠ 0 → ξ ∈ DomC B.h B.qB → inRect B.h γ (G.ctr γ) G.r0 ξ.2.2.2 → dotProduct (nPhi5 B G γ ξ) (G.tH γ (ξ.1, ξ.2.1, ξ.2.2.1) (vco B.h G.r0 γ (G.ctr γ) ξ.2.2.2)) = 0 :=
