  have hid : ∀ η ∈ U, Qb γ.1 * (ubase B η 0 * (sgn γ.2.2 * Bs5 B G γ * G.ustar / 2) / Real.sqrt (Qb γ.1) - vco B.h G.r0 γ (G.ctr γ) η.2.2.2 * (fderiv ℝ (pcPhi2_5 B G γ) (η.1, η.2.1, η.2.2.1) ((0:ℝ), (0:ℝ), (1:ℝ)) + ubase B η 0 * fderiv ℝ (pcPhi2_5 B G γ) (η.1, η.2.1, η.2.2.1) ((1:ℝ), (0:ℝ), (0:ℝ)) + ubase B η 2 * fderiv ℝ (pcPhi2_5 B G γ) (η.1, η.2.1, η.2.2.1) ((0:ℝ), (1:ℝ), (0:ℝ)))) = Br η := by
