  have hS0 : 0 ≤ S := by linarith

  obtain ⟨n, hn⟩ : ∃ n : Fin 3 → Cyl → ℝ, n = fun i ζ => nPhi5 B G γ ζ i := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨P, hP⟩ : ∃ P : Fin 3 → Cyl → ℝ, P = fun i ζ => nPhiP5 B G γ ζ i := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨Ps, hPs⟩ : ∃ Ps : Fin 3 → Cyl → ℝ, Ps = fun i ζ => -P i ζ := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨K, hK⟩ : ∃ K : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Cyl → ℝ, K = fun i j ζ => Kmat B G γ ζ i j := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨ek, hek⟩ : ∃ x : ℝ, x = epsb B.h γ.1 * (kb B.h γ.1 : ℝ) ^ 2 := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hek4 : |ek| ≤ 4 := by rw [hek]; exact hebd γ.1
  obtain ⟨E, hE⟩ : ∃ E : ℝ → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Cyl → ℝ, E = fun e a b ζ => -K a b ζ +
