    · show fB B G l0 (st (i+1)) x t - fB B G l0 (st i) x t = 0
      rw [e1.2.1, e2.2.1, sub_self]
    · show fP5 B G l0 (st (i+1)) x t - fP5 B G l0 (st i) x t = 0
